    <string name="qemu_ram_warning_title">Requested RAM &gt; RAM free right now</string>
    <string name="qemu_ram_warning_message">You asked for %1$d MB for the VM, but this phone has only ~%2$d MB free right now. If Android can\'t give QEMU that much RAM, it may kill Kairos\'s process (OOM) instead of failing with a clear error. You can continue anyway (free RAM keeps changing) or go back and lower it.</string>
